  "ai_summary": "IT consultancy stocks collapsed 35.6% over the year and 25.6% in 30 days, pricing in AI automation risks for outsourcing. Conversely, Indeed dev postings jumped 20.1% annually and 1.6% recently. Big Tech headcounts dipped just 1.4% YoY despite isolated 30-day cuts, while AI lab Anthropic surged 200% YoY with steady 30-day hiring gains (+17). Developers aren't broadly cooked; pressure is concentrated strictly in traditional IT services. Developers aren't cooked; they're just watching the guys who sell overpriced PowerPoint slide decks get slowly roasted on an open flame.",
